rge to 85,968. Therefore, I can be confident that the product of 216 and 398 is 85,968.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 216 and 398 is \\boxed{85968}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 216 and 398, we can break down the multiplication into simpler steps:\n\n1. Recognize that 398 can be expressed as 400 - 2.\n2. Calculate 216 multiplied by 400:\n   \\[\n   216 \\times 400 = 86,400\n   \\]\n3. Calculate 216 multiplied by 2:\n   \\[\n   216 \\times 2 = 432\n   \\]\n4. Subtract the second result from the first:\n   \\[\n   86,400 - 432 = 85,968\n   \\]\n\nVerification using the standard multiplication method:\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n  216 \\\\\n\\times 398 \\\\\n\\hline\n  1748 \\quad \\text{(216 \\times 8)} \\\\\n 19440 \\quad \\text{(216 \\times 9, shifted one position)} \\\\\n 64800 \\quad \\text{(216 \\times 3, shifted two positions)} \\\\\n\\hline\n 85968 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 216 and 398 is \\(\\boxed{85968}\\).",
