5*37. Let's compute that. 655*30=19,650; 655*7=4,585. Then 19,650 +4,585=24,235. Then 589,500 +24,235=613,735. Yes, that's the same result. So that's correct.\n\nTherefore, the product of 655 and 937 is 613,735.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 655 and 937 is \\boxed{613735}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 655 and 937, we can break down the numbers and use the distributive property:\n\n1. Break down 655 into \\(600 + 50 + 5\\) and 937 into \\(900 + 30 + 7\\).\n2. Multiply each part of the first number by each part of the second number and sum the results:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n(600 + 50 + 5) \\times (900 + 30 + 7) &= 600 \\times 900 + 600 \\times 30 + 600 \\times 7 + 50 \\times 900 + 50 \\times 30 + 50 \\times 7 + 5 \\times 900 + 5 \\times 30 + 5 \\times 7 \\\\\n&= 540000 + 18000 + 4200 + 45000 + 1500 + 350 + 4500 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 540000 + 18000 + 4200 + 45000 + 1500 + 350 + 4500 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 558000 + 4200 + 45000 + 1500 + 350 + 4500 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 562200 + 45000 + 1500 + 350 + 4500 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 607200 + 1500 + 350 + 4500 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 608700 + 350 + 4500 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 609050 + 4500 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 613550 + 150 + 35 \\\\\n&= 613700 + 35 \\\\\n&= 613735\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 655 and 937 is \\(\\boxed{613735}\\).",
