   \\[\n       54 \\times 75 = 4050\n       \\]\n     - Add the results:\n       \\[\n       400000 + 60000 + 27000 + 4050 = 491050\n       \\]\n\nThus, the product of 854 and 575 is \\(\\boxed{491050}\\).",
