es 948 = 189600\\)\n   - \\(50 \\times 948 = 47400\\)\n   - Add the results: \\(189600 + 47400 = 237000\\)\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 250 and 948 is \\(\\boxed{237000}\\).",
