y 100)} \\quad 712 \\times 100 = 71200\n   \\]\n\n2. \\( 178 \\times 17 \\):\n   - Calculate \\( 178 \\times 10 \\):\n     \\[\n     178 \\times 10 = 1780\n     \\]\n   - Calculate \\( 178 \\times 7 \\):\n     \\[\n     178 \\times 7 = 1246\n     \\]\n   - Add the results:\n     \\[\n     1780 + 1246 = 3026\n     \\]\n\nNow, add the two results together:\n\n\\[\n71200 + 3026 = 74226\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 178 and 417 is \\(\\boxed{74226}\\).",
