g another method:**\n   - \\(896 = 900 - 4\\)\n   - \\(631 \\times 896 = 631 \\times (900 - 4) = 631 \\times 900 - 631 \\times 4\\)\n   - \\(631 \\times 900 = 567,900\\)\n   - \\(631 \\times 4 = 2,524\\)\n   - \\(567,900 - 2,524 = 565,376\\)\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 631 and 896 is \\(\\boxed{565376}\\).",
