ion.)\n\n3. **Multiply 939 by 300 (shift two positions left):**\n   \\[\n   939 \\times 300 = 281700\n   \\]\n   (Carry over 7, then 21 with carry 2, then 27 with carry 2, resulting in 281700, shifted left by two positions.)\n\n4. **Add the results:**\n   \\[\n   6573 + 75120 + 281700\n   \\]\n   - First, add 6573 and 75120:\n     \\[\n     6573 + 75120 = 81693\n     \\]\n   - Then, add 81693 and 281700:\n     \\[\n     81693 + 281700 = 363393\n     \\]\n\nThus, the product of 939 and 387 is \\(\\boxed{363393}\\).",
